Testing and debugging

1.0 Prerequisites
Node.js installed
npm or pnpm installed

2.0 Installation & Setup
2.1 Backend Setup
cd backend
npm install
npm run init-db

Start backend server
npm start
The server runs on:
http://localhost:50000


2.2Frontend Setup
cd frontend
pnpm install

Troubleshooting Build Script
if there is an error like this: ERR_PNPM_IGNORED_BUILDS] Ignored build scripts: sharp@0.34.5, unrs-resolver@1.11.1
try pnpm approve-builds

Start frontend server
pnpm start
Server local network: http://localhost:3000
server network: http://192.168.56.1.3000

3.0 Testing
The Gadget store application was tested throughout development and ensured that the core features worked correctly.
Testing was focused on user registration, login, product browsing, shopping cart management, and order creation.

3.1 Testing environment

Operating System: Windows 11
Backend: Node.js with Express REST API
Database: SQLite
Responses: JSON
Browser: Opera GX browser
API Testing: Browser and frontend application

